        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-parallel-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Correct or pair two points",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "A correction rejects one framing and supplies another. Paired-addition and two-perspective frames present compatible points; they do not require one to be false.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "不是不想去，而是没有时间。",
                "pinyin": "bùshì bù xiǎng qù ， érshì méiyǒu shíjiān 。",
                "meaning": "It is not that I do not want to go; I do not have time.",
                "audio": "007b74b494d0f20f168e203b60dd033dd1ae54cf80d49ab78e52ae3e7aaf5391"
              },
              {
                "text": "她既会读，也会写。",
                "pinyin": "tā jì huì dú ， yě huì xiě 。",
                "meaning": "She can both read and write.",
                "audio": "cd87ff566d13ccae704c526cb41fb06737fc29fc13f247f8e19a46d23d246fa0"
              },
              {
                "text": "一方面想去，另一方面又想休息。",
                "pinyin": "yīfāngmiàn xiǎng qù ， lìngyīfāngmiàn yòu xiǎng xiūxi 。",
                "meaning": "On one hand I want to go; on the other I want to rest.",
                "audio": "c0b6723b8e5039a18f34e4873286906e92cce4b16193cd48d1de5a0a69c6aea3"
              }
            ]
          },
